        <!-- ==================== COLUMN 5: SIDE PANE WITH 1-22 EXPLANATIONS ==================== -->
        <mxCell id="col5-box" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#090d16;strokeColor=#38bdf8;strokeWidth=2;arcSize=3;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2040" y="115" width="670" height="1380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="col5-hdr" value="&lt;b&gt;Architecture Flow &amp;amp; Execution Lifecycle (1–22)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0369a1;strokeColor=#38bdf8;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=15;align=center;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2055" y="130" width="640" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="legend-text" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.45; color: #e2e8f0; padding-right: 5px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 3px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: #38bdf8;&quot;&gt;[1] Inbound WhatsApp Msg / Photo:&lt;/b&gt; Parents submit natural language curriculum queries, book offers, or textbook cover photos to the WhatsApp Business Number.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 3px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: #38bdf8;&quot;&gt;[2] POST /webhook (HMAC Signed):&lt;/b&gt; Meta Cloud API dispatches signed HTTP POST payloads to Amazon API Gateway /webhook with sub-3s response SLA.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 3px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: #38bdf8;&quot;&gt;[3] Rate Limit &amp;amp; IP Check:&lt;/b&gt; AWS WAF v2 inspects IP reputation, blocks SQLi/XSS bot traffic, and applies rate limiting before Lambda compute execution.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 3px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: #38bdf8;&quot;&gt;[4] Verify HMAC-SHA256:&lt;/b&gt; Lambda executes cryptographic constant-time comparison against App Secret stored in AWS Secrets Manager.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 3px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: #38bdf8;&quot;&gt;[5] Mask PII:&lt;/b&gt; Pre-prompt filter strips and redacts phone numbers, residential addresses, and email accounts into anonymized tokens before passing to LLMs.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 3px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: #38bdf8;&quot;&gt;[6] Forward to Agent Core:&lt;/b&gt; Sanitized message state triggers @aws-blocks/bb-agent running Strands Agents SDK reasoning loops.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 3px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: #38bdf8;&quot;&gt;[7] Multimodal Extraction &amp;amp; Dual-Intent Decomp:&lt;/b&gt; Bedrock extracts title/class from text or photos, decomposing compound buyer &amp;amp; seller intents simultaneously.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 3px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: #38bdf8;&quot;&gt;[7b] Filter Greeting Noise &amp;amp; Auto-Promoter:&lt;/b&gt; Strips conversational filler (&amp;quot;Bonjour tout le monde&amp;quot;) while preserving actionable textbook requests.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 3px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: #38bdf8;&quot;&gt;[8] Declarative Normalizer &amp;amp; Translator:&lt;/b&gt; 4-Stage Regex standardizes subject names and translates French/English curriculum terms into canonical keys.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 3px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: #38bdf8;&quot;&gt;[9] Dual-Track GSI Match Lookup:&lt;/b&gt; Evaluates DynamoDB GSIs by normalized concept keys to locate compatible buyers and active listings.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 3px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: #38bdf8;&quot;&gt;[10] Put/Update Active Inventory (48H Hold: #XXXX):&lt;/b&gt; Locks book listing with cryptographic 4-digit verification code to prevent duplicate claims.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 3px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: #38bdf8;&quot;&gt;[11] Put/Update Demand Wishlist:&lt;/b&gt; Updates demand record to &#39;matched&#39; or logs newly registered wishlist entry in DynamoDB demand-board.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 3px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: #38bdf8;&quot;&gt;[12] 15-Minute Expiry Sweep (holdExpiryCron):&lt;/b&gt; EventBridge cron runs every 15 min, querying DynamoDB to reset expired holds back to &#39;active&#39;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 3px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: #38bdf8;&quot;&gt;[13] 2-Tier Interactive List &amp;amp; Safety Card:&lt;/b&gt; Constructs WhatsApp UI lists for grade/subject selection and 2-button confirmations.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 3px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: #38bdf8;&quot;&gt;[14] WhatsApp Outbound Message:&lt;/b&gt; Dispatches outbound prompts, matches, and notifications via Meta Graph API v25.0 with exponential backoff.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 3px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: #38bdf8;&quot;&gt;[15] Type-Safe JSON-RPC Storefront &amp;amp; Chat:&lt;/b&gt; Single-page web app queries /aws-blocks/api for catalog discovery and community metrics.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 3px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: #38bdf8;&quot;&gt;[16] WebSocket Real-Time Token Streaming:&lt;/b&gt; Streams tokens from Bedrock via WebSocket API Gateway for instantaneous frontend response rendering.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 3px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: #38bdf8;&quot;&gt;[17] Upload Cover &amp;amp; Ingest Vector Chunks (&amp;le; 2KB):&lt;/b&gt; Stores photos in S3 and indexes 2KB embeddings in Amazon Bedrock KnowledgeBase &amp;amp; S3 Vectors.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 3px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: #38bdf8;&quot;&gt;[18] Checkpoint Durable Step Execution:&lt;/b&gt; Lambda Durable state checkpoints execution across multi-step flows to withstand network interruptions.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 3px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: #38bdf8;&quot;&gt;[19] Emit Lifecycle Events:&lt;/b&gt; EventBridge captures ProduceMatch, InventoryActiveHold, HandoverConfirmed, and HoldExpired events.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 3px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: #38bdf8;&quot;&gt;[20] Record EMF Metrics &amp;amp; Traces:&lt;/b&gt; Asynchronously records CloudWatch Embedded Metric Format metrics and X-Ray distributed trace segments.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 3px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: #38bdf8;&quot;&gt;[21] Settle Handover (&#39;Sold&#39; / &#39;Vendu&#39;):&lt;/b&gt; Natural language triggers mark inventory as sold, demands as fulfilled, and notifies both parents.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 3px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: #38bdf8;&quot;&gt;[22] KMS Envelope Encryption:&lt;/b&gt; Customer Managed Key (CMK) provides AES-256 envelope encryption across DynamoDB, S3, and Bedrock vectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
